ariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/04/arrow-electronics-inc-arw-q4-2020-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"ARW 2020 Q4","e":"arw","d":"2021-02-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael J. Long","x":"In terms of the pricing environment, more and more suppliers are raising prices.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/04/arrow-electronics-inc-arw-q4-2020-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"ARW 2020 Q4","e":"arw","d":"2021-02-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael J. Long","x":"We don't have enough margin to absorb price increases like that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/04/arrow-electronics-inc-arw-q4-2020-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"ARW 2021 Q1","e":"arw","d":"2021-05-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Michael J. Long","x":"I mean were tariffs good for manufacturing in the U.S.?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/06/arrow-electronics-inc-arw-q1-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"ARW 2021 Q1","e":"arw","d":"2021-05-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael J. Long","x":"And yes, there is some, I would call it, pass-through pricing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/06/arrow-electronics-inc-arw-q1-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"ARW 2021 Q1","e":"arw","d":"2021-05-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael J. Long","x":"So are you saying that I think the price increases that seem to be coming through are steady.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/06/arrow-electronics-inc-arw-q1-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"ARW 2021 Q2","e":"arw","d":"2021-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael J. Long","x":"And we've seen that from a few of our suppliers, but it has not been widely done at this point, although we do expect price increases over the balance of the next year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/05/arrow-electronics-inc-arw-q2-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"ARW 2021 Q2","e":"arw","d":"2021-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael J. Long","x":"So price increases are real, they're for a real reason more than just the demand piece.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/05/arrow-electronics-inc-arw-q2-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"ARW 2021 Q3","e":"arw","d":"2021-11-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael J. Long","x":"With some of that price increase is also why you see increased inventory, not necessarily more units, but increased price on the inventory that we have.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/04/arrow-electronics-inc-arw-q3-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"ARW 2021 Q3","e":"arw","d":"2021-11-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael J. Long","x":"By the way, the price increases are just really coming through.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/04/arrow-electronics-inc-arw-q3-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"ARW 2021 Q3","e":"arw","d":"2021-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael J. Long","x":"There is no more year-over-year cost reduction on parts like there used to be.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/04/arrow-electronics-inc-arw-q3-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"ARW 2024 Q4","e":"arw","d":"2025-02-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Sean Kerins","x":"Strength in hybrid cloud solutions, infrastructure software, including cybersecurity, and improving data center activity related to AI adoption drove our results.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/arrow-arw-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARW 2024 Q4","e":"arw","d":"2025-02-06","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Melissa Fairbanks","x":"Wondering if you guys happen to see any pull-ins in the December quarter, either ahead of potential tariff activity, annual price increases or some end-of-life activity on some of the higher-end devices?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/arrow-arw-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARW 2024 Q4","e":"arw","d":"2025-02-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Raj Agrawal","x":"And since then, we've taken at least $200 million of cost, annual cost out of the business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/arrow-arw-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARW 2024 Q4","e":"arw","d":"2025-02-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Joe Quatrochi","x":"And then how do we kind of flow in the cost savings and some of the restructuring that you're doing?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/arrow-arw-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARW 2025 Q2","e":"arw","d":"2025-07-31","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Sean J. Kerins","x":"Examples include hybrid cloud solutions, the deployment of infrastructure software in areas such as virtualization and data protection and the early innings of AI in the traditional data center.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/04/arrow-arw-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARW 2025 Q2","e":"arw","d":"2025-07-31","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Sean J. Kerins","x":"In regard to tariffs, due to uncertainty around future trade policy, we saw modest order acceleration in Asia alongside less tariff uplift than anticipated in the U.S. These dynamics did not materially impact our second quarter results, nor have we contemplated any material impact in our third…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/04/arrow-arw-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARW 2025 Q2","e":"arw","d":"2025-07-31","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Rajesh K. Agrawal","x":"You will recall that in our Q2 outlook that we provided last quarter, we highlighted a potential 2% to 4% incremental lift to global component sales from tariff billing impacts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/04/arrow-arw-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARW 2025 Q2","e":"arw","d":"2025-07-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rajesh K. Agrawal","x":"But the gross margin is likely to see continued mix shift given the APAC growth in components as well as the large customer mix that we have, but we are certainly offsetting that with some of our productivity and cost savings initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/04/arrow-arw-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARW 2025 Q4","e":"arw","d":"2026-02-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"William Austen","x":"The secular growth in cloud, AI and data center demand is creating tailwinds for both our components and ECS businesses, particularly in areas like AI infrastructure build-out, where our supply chain services are increasingly critical.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/arrow-arw-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARW 2025 Q4","e":"arw","d":"2026-02-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Ruplu Bhattacharya","x":"I think, Bill, you mentioned AI infrastructure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/arrow-arw-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARW 2025 Q4","e":"arw","d":"2026-02-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William Austen","x":"We have more work to do, but our productivity and cost-out efforts are becoming part of everyday life at Arrow as it creates operating leverage and reinvestment capacity in the business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/arrow-arw-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARW 2025 Q4","e":"arw","d":"2026-02-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rajesh Agrawal","x":"Importantly, our ongoing cost savings initiatives have supported a lower OpEx as a percent of gross profit, which declined 700 basis points sequentially and 100 basis points year-over-year to 67%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/arrow-arw-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARW 2026 Q1","e":"arw","d":"2026-05-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rajesh Agrawal","x":"First, as pockets of supply became constrained for technologies around AI investments, hardware sales saw strong momentum in the first quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/arrow-arw-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ARW 2026 Q1","e":"arw","d":"2026-05-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rajesh Agrawal","x":"By normalizing for the 4 extra days, our global ECS business still achieved year-over-year growth in billings, net sales, gross profit and operating income dollars, reflecting our alignment to the high-growth demand trends behind AI and data center build-out.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/arrow-arw-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ARW 2026 Q1","e":"arw","d":"2026-05-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Eric Nowak","x":"We believe that the customers place their orders in advance to avoid price increase and be sure to be delivered during the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/arrow-arw-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ARW 2026 Q1","e":"arw","d":"2026-05-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Rajesh Agrawal","x":"And yes, we've seen the price increases there as well, but still in the mid-single-digit range in terms of exposure to our revenue, so not a big impact.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/arrow-arw-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ARW 2026 Q1","e":"arw","d":"2026-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rajesh Agrawal","x":"The restructuring efforts we have executed the past couple of years are bearing fruit as we gain operating momentum and drive substantial operating leverage in the business model.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/arrow-arw-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ARW 2026 